WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.467
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.868
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.334
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:08.434
President Biden had his annual
physical today at Walter Reid.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.701
Doctors say he is fit
as a fiddle,

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:14.200
specifically this 300-year-old
Stradivarius.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:18.667
That's right. President Biden
today had his annual physical,

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.667
and I think Fox News messed with
his eye chart.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:23.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.567
It wouldn't count.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.567
Wouldn't be legally binding.

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:31.334
According to a new report, top
Democrats privately think that

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:34.400
President Biden is too old for
re-election but worry that his

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.901
decision not to run would cause
chaos in the Democratic Party.

00:00:37.901 --> 00:00:39.834
You guys didn't see this coming?

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:44.167
We elected a half finished game
of Jenga and now

00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:47.234
you're all saying, "Oh,
everybody move your drinks!"

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:49.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.434
President Biden spoke publicly
today about the aerial objects

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:53.634
shot down by the military.

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:55.968
Said Biden, "The American people
deserve to know

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:58.801
how much fun this week has been
for me."

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:04.167
Acting FAA administrator
Billy Nolen testified before

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.834
the Senate yesterday on
the agency's handling of recent

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:09.000
near collisions at airports

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.601
and assured Americans that
flying is safe.

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:13.901
I don't know. At this point,
the best can you say is that

00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:16.200
it's safer than traveling via
balloon.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:20.734
I would not want to travel via
balloon right now.

00:01:22.534 --> 00:01:25.501
The FAA this week announced
plans for an airline industry

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:28.501
safety summit after a recent
series of near accidents.

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:30.434
But don't worry, you only need
to attend

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:32.000
if you're in the exit row.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.133
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:39.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.467
Oye, boy, oh, boy.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:45.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:51.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:51.634 --> 00:01:54.634
A lawyer for Florida Congressman
Matt Gaetz said yesterday that

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:57.100
the Justice Department informed
Gaetz that they will not move

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.834
forward with charges relating to
his sex trafficking

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:02.734
investigation and that Gaetz has
learned his lesson.

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:04.701
Venmo set to private.

00:02:04.701 --> 00:02:07.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:09.601
"The New York Times" published
an op-ed yesterday about

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:11.767
Republican presidential hopeful
Nikki Haley

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:14.100
titled "Nikki Haley will not be
the next president."

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.267
Yeah, I'm not falling for
that one anymore.

00:02:16.267 --> 00:02:19.534
The last guy they said would
never be the next president,

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:21.400
turns out he was
the next president.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.801
Also, still might be
the next president.

00:02:23.801 --> 00:02:25.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:28.167
Elon Musk said yesterday that
artificial intelligence has

00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:30.834
great promise and capability but
added that it

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:32.434
comes with "great danger."

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:35.167
So either he's one of the great
minds of our generation

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:37.300
or he finally saw
"The Terminator."

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.434
According to a new study,
Cleveland and Detroit are

00:02:41.434 --> 00:02:43.968
the least expensive U.S. cities
for single people

00:02:43.968 --> 00:02:45.601
in the same way that
the cheapest car

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:47.367
you can buy is just to walk.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:53.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.667 --> 00:02:57.734
And finally, today was National
Do a Grouch a Favor Day.

00:02:57.734 --> 00:03:01.200
Okay. Off the top of my head,
let him crash with you?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.901
Hey, it's our friend who lives
in the garbage and eats trash.

00:03:04.901 --> 00:03:06.534
Welp, see you later.

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:08.534
That was a monologue, everybody.

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:10.968
We are off and running.

